{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Settle in to your new job, there's a lot of work that needs doing. Complete the tasks given, and look after the creatures. Just finish all 4 shifts to receive your paycheck. Do not cross your boundaries, we are watching.<br><br>You're required\u00a0to upkeep the facility by doing the tasks provided. Clean up rubbish, fix oxygen vents, and keep the creatures in line. Either do all the tasks yourself or split them with up to 2 friends. You have been given access to the control room where you can monitor the facility. Do not be alarmed by large vent, it is usually harmless.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3584090?t=1742608633","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584090/48197e9633d19c330eeaac1eed951b534ca5a524/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742608633","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584090/9fabfe28e2abf8dbc66ba429b5165a5b92553388/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742608633","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584090/9fabfe28e2abf8dbc66ba429b5165a5b92553388/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742608633","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The mature content comes in the form of the instructor who is on the megaphone at the beginning of each shift."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Settle in to your new job, there's a lot of work that needs doing. Complete the tasks given, and look after the creatures. Just finish all 4 shifts to receive your paycheck. Do not cross your boundaries, we are watching.<br><br>You're required\u00a0to upkeep the facility by doing the tasks provided. Clean up rubbish, fix oxygen vents, and keep the creatures in line. Either do all the tasks yourself or split them with up to 2 friends. You have been given access to the control room where you can monitor the facility. Do not be alarmed by large vent, it is usually harmless.</p>","developers":["ThatCarrotFella"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584090/a7a192fdb8cf07c5daeea77e418d0ea0af388812/header.jpg?t=1742608633","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Planet IX","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel 5<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1660<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["ThatCarrotFella"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Linguagem impr\u00f3pria\nViol\u00eancia","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt\nDerbe Sprache","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"req